					"nextDialogs": [
						401570618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "德沃沙克"
				},
				{
					"id": 401570618,
					"content": "这个放牛的！又想一个人出风头！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401570619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401570619,
					"content": "那派蒙也去献唱吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401570620
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401570620,
					"content": "哼哼，要是那样，恐怕放牛的就一点风头都没了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401570621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401570621,
					"content": "他肯定会大喊着「派蒙真是太摇滚了！」然后哇哇乱哭跑下台。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
